  "body": "The `get_forgotten_rooms_for_user` cache is only invalidated when a user `/forget`s a room, and not when a user re-joins a room.\r\n\r\nI think this means we may exclude previously-forgotten rooms from an initial `/sync`, even if the user is now joined to them.",
